# Fungi tuft 1: a tuft of eight fairy-ring champignons about 0.5 m tall, buff-tan caps like flat domes on slender cream stems,
# the tallest in the middle, round a small mound of humus. Oversized for the forest floor, so it reads at a distance; the
# counterpart of flower1.
format 1

